MiuxH CDJ Player View community test port, GPL-3.0-only.
The legacy-v22 folder preserves the prior Player View work unchanged, except
player_view_draw.c was recopied identically before adapting a separate chrome.c.
Original integration base: Kyle-Hosman/xdj-az-mods, commit
3e0c5cb010454228f4ee63226b60d060494eeaae, with MiuxH Player View V22 changes.
Pure layout helpers and CDJ-inspired chrome are reused under GPL-3.0-only.
The new community adapter does not link or redistribute the AZ-MODS core.
All fonts and native waveform/cue components are used from the running firmware;
no Pioneer/AlphaTheta font, artwork, firmware or music bytes are distributed.
CDJ-3000 and XDJ-AZ are their respective owners' marks; this is an unofficial mod.
